       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SD-SMOKE.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
           COPY 'request.cpy'.
           COPY 'result.cpy'.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           INITIALIZE SD-REQUEST SD-RESULT
           MOVE 'SDABI001' TO SD-ABI-VERSION
           CALL 'SYNTHETIC-DAVID-CORP' USING SD-REQUEST SD-RESULT
           IF SD-RESULT-STATUS NOT = 'HALTED'
               DISPLAY 'FAIL: MISSING ID WAS NOT REJECTED'
               STOP RUN
           END-IF
           MOVE ALL '1' TO SD-REQUEST-ID SD-TRACE-ID SD-GRAPH-ID
           MOVE 'LOCAL-REVIEWER' TO SD-REQUESTOR
           MOVE 'LEDGER-VALIDATE' TO SD-REQUEST-TYPE
           MOVE 2 TO SD-PAYLOAD-LENGTH
           MOVE '{}' TO SD-PAYLOAD
           CALL 'SYNTHETIC-DAVID-CORP' USING SD-REQUEST SD-RESULT
           IF SD-RESULT-STATUS NOT = 'HALTED'
               DISPLAY 'FAIL: MISSING BROKER WAS NOT REJECTED'
               STOP RUN
           END-IF
           DISPLAY 'PASS: MISSING ID AND MISSING BROKER FAIL CLOSED'
           STOP RUN.
